Keys ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 Sessions
  1/2                  switch between Sessions and Quotas
  up/down, j/k         select a session
  pgup/pgdn, g/G       page, first, last
  enter or c           open the conversation of the session
  e                    enter the session (ctrl+] to return)
  m                    send a message to the session as yourself
  s                    start a worker (a form: project, harness, model, task)
  x                    stop the selected worker (asks y/n)
  t                    cycle request rule: normal, ask, auto
  p                    delegation policy: subagent or worker for code changes (…
  I                    integrations for all machines: six checkboxes (a form)
  M                    map: charters, maturity, edges and history (read only)
  C                    CTO: chat, open full UI, new conversation and undo
  N                    name the machine of the session (every machine sees it; …
  L                    what the network learned: playbook notes and their suppo…
  /                    filter (words match name, project, branch, model, ...)
  o, d                 o: show offline and dormant; d: detail takes the feed ro…
  a                    active only: hide sessions idle for over an hour
  tab                  message feed and back; enter opens the conversation of t…
  v, l                 v: open the body of the message; l: feed events (worker,…
  r                    refresh now
esc close help  q quit
